{
  "bodyHash": "ydQ4Naiyjno=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，用心製作。包含眾多適用於 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">營火重生與調整模組新增了在營火中設定重生點的功能，並對該方塊的相關機制進行了一些調整。預設情況下，你重生時會獲得 10 秒的火焰抗性，並且會出現在營火上方。此功能適用於主世界、地獄與終界，也適用於模組新增的維度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">營火初始為熄滅狀態。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">點燃營火會在營火上方建立重生點。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">使用沙、泥土或靈魂沙對營火按右鍵可將其熄滅。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">浸水的營火可以用打火石對其按右鍵移除水分。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">防止在點擊營火側面時在相鄰方塊上放置火焰。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">如果玩家重生在營火內，將獲得 10 秒的火焰保護。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">如果重生時營火上方有方塊擋住，會產生一個兩格高的空氣空間。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">蹲下 + 對床按右鍵會覆蓋營火的重生位置。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">◉</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">蹲下 + 對營火按右鍵會移除重生位置。或者在點燃時同樣操作，可防止設定重生點。</span></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"前置模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，新放置的營火會是熄滅狀態。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">蹲下並對營火按右鍵可移除營火重生點。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，在床上睡覺會覆蓋營火重生點。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，若重生時營火上方有方塊擋住，模組會破壞這些方塊。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，每次設定新的營火重生點時，會向玩家發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，每次移除營火重生點時，會向玩家發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，每次重生時營火重生點遺失時，會向玩家發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，當營火重生點被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 覆蓋時，會向玩家發送提示訊息。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10000，最小值 0，最大值 3600000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家在營火處重生時獲得的火焰抗性持續時間（毫秒）。設為 0 會停用此功能，並改為將玩家放置在營火旁邊。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">放置與破壞營火，以設定和移除重生點：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在營火上放置泥土來熄滅它：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在營火處重生：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從地獄在地獄內重生：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從主世界在地獄內重生：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用打火石點燃營火以移除其積水：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由地將此模組用於任何模組包中，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
